WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.400
This mission is a simple in and out.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.240
Agent Valerian, you'll be running solo.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:13.800
I only work with my partner. We're a team.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:15.300
Let's go!

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:28.400
You are running nearly twenty minutes late.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.400
Yeah, well time flies when you are having fun.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.200
Welcome to Alpha.

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:50.320
The city of a thousand planets.

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:54.120
where for hundreds of years,

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:56.240
every species has shared their knowledge.

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:58.540
and their intelligence

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:00.080
with each other.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.000
It's paradise

00:01:04.360 --> 00:01:05.340
Amazing

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:16.060
After centuries of peace and prosperity

00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:21.460
an unknown force wants to destroy all we have created

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:27.520
Agents Valerian and Laureline, you have less than 10 hours to find the threat and eliminate it

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:45.520
The whole universe is after us

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:49.340
We need the two of you to be the guardians of our future

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:03.720
You sure you know what you are doing?

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:06.860
Valerian, trust me

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:10.000
How much time left?

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:21.060
I taught him how to do that

